      "Emissions measurement requires defined organizational and operational boundaries, Scope 1, Scope 2 and Scope 3 categories, a reporting period and a methodology. Electricity, fuel, transport, raw materials and waste treatment have different data sources.",
      "Do not combine emission factors with incompatible units or boundaries. Record each factor’s source, year, country, allocation method and uncertainty level.",
      "Prioritize activity data supported by evidence and establish validation and record-retention procedures. Do not claim carbon neutrality or emissions reductions without an appropriate methodology and verification.",
