      "Before go-live, check master data, user permissions, devices, network connectivity, backups, user guides, support procedures and rollback scenarios.",
      "Use parallel operation for a limited period when necessary, but set an end date for duplicate entry to prevent conflicting data sources. Assign support personnel to each shift.",
      "The go-live checklist should be signed by business owners, IT, security, operations and the project manager. Track issues by severity and publish their resolution status.",
